## Locked rules (always apply)

LOCKED RULE · #org
Never mix data from different lab customers
Set by @greg · Head of Security · locked 7 Sep
Never combine **Lab A** and **Lab B** data in one export, dataset, eval set or pipeline run. Every export must pass `assertSingleCustomer(rows)` before it writes. Test fixtures included. Owner: @greg. Applies to #org and everything below it.

LOCKED RULE · #org
Never log expert personal info
Set by @greg · Head of Security · locked 16 Sep
Expert names, emails and payout details live only in the `pii` schema. Never write them to logs, traces, error messages or analytics events. Log the `expert_id` instead. Owner: @greg.

